Just got my first tournament ascension for the year.  This is the
first time I've ascended in a while, and I'd completely forgotten how
utterly painful the latter stage of the game is.  No, I'm not talking
about the mysterious force (though it is clearly an effort on the
DevTeam's part to increase the suicide rate amongst those who favor
lawfully aligned characters).  I'm talking about the ridiculous number
of things going on, all of which Nethack insists on reporting, which
results in gameplay that goes something like

MOVE
SPACE BAR [x10]
MOVE
SPACE BAR [x6]
MOVE
SPACE BAR [x15]
...

Is there any way to 1) make Nethack waaay less chatty (setting
"verbose" to false doesn't seem to make much of a difference), 2)
inform Nethack that I'm playing in a terminal window with extra rows
for it to dump its commentary into, or 3) some other solution to this
problem?  Any suggestions would be much appreciated!  Thanks.

